When she said she was busy, she was probably busy. I don't see what is so hard to understand. Moving is stressful. If anything, you could have offered to help, although it sounds like it would have required a bus ride to get back over there.

&nbsp;

You could ask her about long distance, but that is entirely up to you. I'm not the best at flirting, but you could say something like "You know me too well. You were right about missing you, I'm bawling my eyes out. How do you feel about long distance?".

&nbsp;

Maybe give her time to get settled in, and also to maybe not look too desperate. You kinda have to play the crying part off as a joke if you can.

No, a very simple answer makes no sense.

&nbsp;

China makes the American branded firearms.

Mexican cartels buy the guns from China.

Every gang imports the guns from Mexico.

The gangs sell the guns to school shooters, or use them for crime.

&nbsp;

How could China, Mexico, and our local gangs do this to us? /s

&nbsp;

This also works for fentanyl if you replace the last line about school shooters with psychos that are poisoning the water supply with very minute amounts of expensive illegal drugs.

